    "heading": "Wand of Wonder",
    "lineStart": 17261,
    "lineEnd": 17261
  },
  "columns": [
    "56-60",
    "A magically formed creature appears in an unoccupied space as close to the chosen point of origin as possible. The creature isn’t under your control, acts as it normally would, and disappears after 1 hour or when it drops to 0 Hit Points. Roll Id4 to determine which creature appears. On a 1, a Rhinoceros appears; on a 2, an Elephant appears; and on a 3-4, a Rat appears."
  ],
  "rows": []
}
